   "title": "Working",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&A\\cup B=\\{a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,j\\}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{(A }\\cup B)'=U-\\text{ (A }\\cup \\text{ B) }=\\{i\\}\\ldots (1)\\\\[5pt]&A'=U-A=\\{e,f,i,j\\}\\\\[5pt]&B'=U-B=\\{a,b,g,h,i\\}\\\\[5pt]&A'\\cap B'=\\{i\\}\\ldots (2)\\\\[5pt]&\\text{From }(1)\\text{ and }(2):\\text{ (A }\\cup B)'=A'\\cap B'\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\text{(first law verified)}\\\\[5pt]&A\\cap B=\\{c,d\\}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{(A }\\cap B)'=U-\\text{ (A }\\cap \\text{ B) }=\\\\[5pt]&\\quad \\{a,b,e,f,g,h,i,j\\}\\ldots (3)\\end{aligned}\\]",
